5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,We should ensure our choice is based on actual utility rather than just the prestige of the proposal.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I agree. We need to understand how these projects impact our daily operations and room availability.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,George,,It is also vital to consider the people who will actually maintain these facilities once they are finished.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,We must be realistic about delivery. I want to see why previous projects have faced such significant delays.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,Precisely. I am interested in whether our budget projections actually align with current market costs.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I will look into the post-occupancy reviews and the survey findings in the older blocks.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Victoria,,I'll examine the booking data and the timetable records for rooms out of service.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,George,,I'll check the staffing posts and the bench technicians' weekly manual routines.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,I'll investigate the site diaries for weather days and the delivery schedules by project rationale.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I shall review the tender records and the renewal reserve for equipment.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
