60,3,1,talk,Toshio,,"Candidate B, the Study Commons, fits the need for general-use space and high user satisfaction.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Victoria,,"B is attractive, but we must consider the cost of the hall being out of service during conversion.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,George,,"Candidate A, the Ventilation Upgrade, would directly eliminate those manual routines the technicians are struggling with.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Mizuki,,"A and C involve high risk. C is exposed to weather, and A is a mechanical project prone to delays.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,A is financially risky due to rising plant costs. B or D seem more budget-stable.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Toshio,,D is a specialist center; my findings suggest those are less utilized than general spaces like B.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Victoria,,"I agree. The demand for general study space is constant, whereas D might end up idle.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,George,,"While B is popular, A solves a genuine labor problem for our remaining staff.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Mizuki,,B is an internal conversion. It avoids the weather risks of C and the complexity of A.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Benjamin,,B is the most rational choice. It avoids the volatile mechanical market and serves the most people.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Toshio,,I am convinced B is the best way to ensure the project is a success.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Victoria,,"I will support B, provided we manage the temporary room displacement carefully.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,George,,"I still lean toward A for the staff, but I see the logic for B.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Mizuki,,B is the only one with a high probability of being delivered on time.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Benjamin,,Logic dictates B. It is the safest financial and operational bet.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
